    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >main character \u201cYouto\u201d is a lethargic recluse who wastes his days meaninglessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can use the \u201caction button\u201d to make Youto temporarily active.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While taking a peek into Youto's daily life, players can change his life by making good use of the action button!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >button is a mysterious button that temporarily activates Youto when pressed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is also the only way for players to interfere with Youto, and appears when necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make good use of the action button and change Youto's life for the better!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Novel PartThis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >novel part is mainly composed of text and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D animation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The scenario has several branches and multiple endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walking Part</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >: A walking part where you get out of your house and parade around the shopping district.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The scenario progresses as you interact with the facilities and various people in the shopping district.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay-at-home</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >part: A part where Youto stays at home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can get a glimpse of Youto's daily routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It includes events that allow you to get to know the personal side of Youto.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distribution GuidelinesThis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >title allows you to play the game live, post videos and stream the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would appreciate it if you could include your store link in the summary section.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Translated with  (free version)</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >main character \u201cYouto\u201d is a lethargic recluse who wastes his days meaninglessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can use the \u201caction button\u201d to make Youto temporarily active.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While taking a peek into Youto's daily life, players can change his life by making good use of the action button!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >button is a mysterious button that temporarily activates Youto when pressed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is also the only way for players to interfere with Youto, and appears when necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make good use of the action button and change Youto's life for the better!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Novel PartThis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >novel part is mainly composed of text and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D animation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The scenario has several branches and multiple endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walking Part</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >: A walking part where you get out of your house and parade around the shopping district.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The scenario progresses as you interact with the facilities and various people in the shopping district.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay-at-home</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >part: A part where Youto stays at home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can get a glimpse of Youto's daily routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It includes events that allow you to get to know the personal side of Youto.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distribution GuidelinesThis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >title allows you to play the game live, post videos and stream the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would appreciate it if you could include your store link in the summary section.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Translated with  (free version)</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Yuto, a lethargic shut-in, steps out into the outside world through the \u201caction button,\u201d which becomes active when pressed. A 3D adventure game that lets you look into Youto's daily life while making full use of the action buttons.",
